{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1513919-where-can-i-find-all-the-references-between-gamelines","id":1513919,"title":"Where can I find all the references between gamelines?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-04T23:49:59-07:00","id":1513919,"title":"Where can I find all the references between gamelines?","content":"It's admittedly been quite a while since I was actually keeping up with that sort of thing, but is there anywhere I could find a comprehensive guide to the intratextuality between the gamelines?<br /> <br /> Stuff like how the Aegis Kai Doru are being manipulated by the Guardians of the Veil, or the connection between the Les Enfants Terrible in Inferno and the Lucifuge. I just was talking with someone in a CofD chat who pointed out that there's a reference to Descent Demons five years before Descent in the Horror Recognition Guide, and how there's references to clockwork heaven or hell even as far back as the original corebook.<br /> <br /> I want to know more about that stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","